---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const privacySchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Privacy Policy - StudentKit",
  "url": "https://studentkit.in/privacy"
};
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="StudentKit Privacy Policy. Learn about our commitment to 100% client-side calculation privacy.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(privacySchema)}></script>
  </Fragment>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-muted">Last Updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-5 text-slate-muted bg-card p-4 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-border-line/80 shadow-xs">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">1. Overview & Core Privacy Promise</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          At StudentKit, your privacy is paramount. Our fundamental architecture is built around client-side computation: all calculator inputs, formulas, grades, and variables entered into our tools are processed entirely within your web browser. We do not store or transmit your calculations to remote servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">2. Data We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>We do not require user accounts or registrations.</li>
          <li>We do not collect names, passwords, or phone numbers.</li>
          <li>We do not store student grade transcripts or exam scores.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">3. Local Storage</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          StudentKit may use standard browser `localStorage` solely to enhance your user experience (such as remembering your recently opened calculators). This information remains stored strictly on your device and can be cleared at any time through your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">4. Third-Party Services & Analytics</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We use Google Analytics and Google AdSense to understand general traffic trends and fund server hosting. These providers may use cookies and web beacons to serve non-personalized or personalized advertisements based on your prior visits. You can manage cookie preferences via your browser settings or Google Ad settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">5. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us via <a href="mailto:sahilsleem01@gmail.com" class="text-brand underline hover:text-brand-accent font-medium">Email</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
